# Neighborhood Minecraft Server

Self-hosted crossplay Paper server with an in-game AI `/agent` and a Cursor
MCP integration. The whole stack is defined by `docker-compose.yml` and
spun up via `make up`.

## Stack

| Service | Image | Container | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `mc` | `itzg/minecraft-server:java25` | `mc-lan` | Paper 26.1.2 + Geyser + Floodgate + FAWE |
| `mc-agent` | local build (`agent/Dockerfile`) | `mc-agent` | FastAPI orchestrator behind `/agent` (no published port) |
| `playit` | `ghcr.io/playit-cloud/playit-agent` | `playit-agent` | TCP/UDP relay for public crossplay |
| `backup` | `itzg/mc-backup` | `mc-backup` | RCON-coordinated `save-off`/`save-on`, 2h interval, 14d retention |
| `ollama` (profile `ollama`) | `ollama/ollama` | `mc-ollama` | Optional bundled LLM; default is host Ollama |

- **Building plugin**: FastAsyncWorldEdit (FAWE) `2.15.1` (Modrinth-managed)
- **Crossplay**: Bedrock players appear with a leading `.` (Floodgate
  prefix), e.g. `.BedrockPlayer`. Always include the dot.
- **GC**: Generational ZGC. `USE_MEOWICE_FLAGS=false` on purpose
  (JDK-8359378 G1 barrier crash on aarch64 + Java 25). Don't re-enable
  without confirming a Temurin fix.

## Server defaults (creative-mode friends server)

- `MODE=creative`, `FORCE_GAMEMODE=true`, `ALLOW_FLIGHT=true`,
  `SPAWN_PROTECTION=0`
- `ONLINE_MODE=true`, `ENFORCE_SECURE_PROFILE=false`
- `ENFORCE_WHITELIST` defaults to **true** for the public repo; flip to
  `MC_ENFORCE_WHITELIST=false` in `.env` for the open friends-server mode.
- `OPS:` block in compose is commented out by default; persist in-game
  ops via `EXISTING_OPS_FILE: MERGE`. Manually opped players survive
  restarts.
- `AGENT_API_TOKEN` is **required** at boot (`${AGENT_API_TOKEN:?...}`);
  `make bootstrap` writes a random token into `.env`.

## Files in this workspace

- `docker-compose.yml` — the whole stack (mc, mc-agent, playit, backup, ollama profile)
- `Makefile` — `make help` for every target (bootstrap, up, plugin, seed, test, smoke, eval, corpus, train, etc.)
- `.env` — `PLAYIT_SECRET_KEY`, `AGENT_API_TOKEN`, `MC_ENFORCE_WHITELIST`, `OLLAMA_BASE_URL`, `COMPOSE_PROFILES`, etc. (gitignored)
- `.env.example` — public template; copied by `make bootstrap`
- `secrets/rcon_password` — RCON password (Docker secret, gitignored)
- `agent/` — orchestrator package, tools package, tool registry, eval harness, templates, training
  - `agent/orchestrator/app.py` — FastAPI app (runs as `mc-agent`)
  - `agent/tools/` — typed RCON tools (admin, builders, FAWE, templates, inspection)
  - `agent/tool_registry.py` — single source of truth (`TOOLS_VERSION = "2.9.0"`)
  - `agent/templates/catalog.json` + `agent/templates/schematics/*.schem` — 101 verified schematics
- `plugins/neighborhood-agent/` — Paper `/agent` Java plugin source
- `mcp/minecraft_build_mcp.py` — thin Cursor MCP adapter (re-uses `agent/tools/`)
- `.cursor/mcp.json` — registers the `minecraft-builder` MCP
- `mc.sh`, `op.sh`, `scripts/build-plugin.sh`, `scripts/bootstrap.sh`, etc.
- `data/` — world + plugins (gitignored)
- `backups/` — mc-backup archives (gitignored)

## Ports

- `25565/tcp` published — Java
- `19132/udp` published — Bedrock (Geyser)
- `25575/tcp` **not published** — RCON, container-internal only by design
- `8787/tcp` **not published** — `mc-agent` orchestrator, Compose-network only
- `11434/tcp` (when `--profile ollama` active) **not published** — bundled Ollama
